ATTRIBUTION

This repository is derived from the VMware/Broadcom sample project
"packer-examples-for-vsphere", distributed under the BSD 2-Clause License and
available at https://github.com/vmware-samples/packer-examples-for-vsphere.

The build definitions, kickstart/preseed/autoinstall/Autounattend templates,
Ansible roles and Terraform examples in this repository originate in that
project. Modifications made here adapt them to this environment: fixed guest
addresses, site-specific vSphere inventory names, Salt minion installation,
Windows hardening payloads, and the Photon OS 5 migration kit.

